e in my experience"}],"t":8774.576},{"b":[{"id":"subscriber","v":"0"}],"u":{"n":"Luke353777","c":"#1A127F"},"f":[{"t":"It's a bit of a spacing matter"}],"t":8775.08},{"b":[{"id":"subscriber","v":"3"},{"id":"destiny-2-final-shape-raid-race","v":"1"}],"u":{"n":"fullmetalcris","c":"#1E90FF"},"f":[{"t":"@surdejs_elsker_number1 lmao"}],"t":8777.199},{"b":[{"id":"twitch-recap-2024","v":"1"}],"u":{"n":"WES9S","c":"#008000"},"f":[{"t":"the fighting tutorials help a bit if you want to try those. just back out of this and it\u2019s on the other side of the room"}],"t":8779.02},{"b":[],"u":{"n":"shipgosync","c":"#FF69B4"},"f":[{"t":"I believe there is also the practise vs specific enemies mode if that helps, sorry if this has been said before x"}],"t":8779.253},{"b":[{"id":"subscriber","v":"0"}],"u":{"n":"Luke353777","c":"#1A127F"},"f":[{"t":"She does it as a gap closer"}],"t":8781.299},{"b":[{"id":"hornet","v":"1"}],"u":{"n":"asaad_9","c":"#DBBDEE"},"f":[{"t":"dw its the intended experience it said in the main menu"}],"t":8781.97},{"b":[{"id":"","v":""},{"id":"marathon-reveal-runner","v":"1"}],"u":{"n":"athletic_heart","c":"#FF0000"},"f":[{"t":"@AlduinFeetPics i'm joining in"}],"t":8782.564},{"b":[{"id":"twitch-recap-2025","v":"1"}],"u":{"n":"resurrectionbyelection","c":"#8A2BE2"},"f":[{"t":"@duskwaterdrm in what framerate?"}],"t":8783.608},{"b":[{"id":"final-fantasy-xiv-fan-festival-2026-na---fat-cat","v":"1"}],"u":{"n":"AsuraAYAYA","c":"#00FF7F"},"f":[{"t":"its reactable"}],"t":8783.626},{"b":[{"id":"subscriber","v":"3"},{"id":"destiny-2-final-shape-raid-race","v":"1"}],"u":{"n":"fullmetalcris","c":"#1E90FF"},"f":[{"t":"you have to enter the matrix for that"}],"t":8788.011},{"b":[{"id":"lead_moderator","v":"1"},{"id":"","v":""},{"id":"hornet","v":"1"}],"u":{"n":"AlduinFeetPics","c":"#B22222"},"f":[{"t":"@Mkrazcal_ too late, buying it. you will be so owned when it arrives"}],"t":8788.382},{"b":[{"id":"subscriber","v":"6"},{"id":"superultracombo-2023","v":"1"}],"u":{"n":"theb